<title>USA: Gabelli group hikes stake in Cablevision.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group hikes stake in Cablevision.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York money manager Mario Gabelli said Tuesday it raised its stake in Cablevision Systems Corp to 2,426,604 Class A common shares or 20.91 percent of the class outstanding from 19.75 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought a net of 97,400 shares between August 6 and August 29 at prices ranging from $39.5737 to $42.25 per share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
